camlab-rpi (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release. Notes:
    https://github.com/Kurokesu/camlab-rpi/releases/tag/v1.2.0
  * Render Depends from apt-packages and sensor registry in source tree.
  * Move sensor drivers from Suggests back to Depends, adding
    os08e10-rpi-dkms. An app update now brings driver for a newly
    supported sensor.
  * Floor libcamera at 1:0.7.2+rpt20260817+krks4, rpicam-apps at
    1:1.13.0+krks1 and cage at 0.3.1.
  * Add wlrctl, camlab uses it to carry pointer onto monitor.
  * Drop unread version stamp from postinst.

 -- Danius Kalvaitis <danius@kurokesu.com>  Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:18:38 +0300

